---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <article>
    <p class="meta">16 August 2026 · blog post</p>
    <h1>Hello, World!</h1>
    <p class="lede">And hello, static site generator.</p>
    <p>This collection of <code>.astro</code> files and a <code>deploy.yml</code>, running on the steam engine that is github pages, will hopefully one day become a beautiful blog. Or something else.</p>
    <p><a href="/notes/">Back to notes</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  article { max-width: 39rem; }
  .meta { color: #6d7369; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.45; margin-block: 2rem; }
</style>
